# "Return a land you control to its owner's hand" is not a target and not optional: with Boros Garrison as the only land
# Bot1 controls, it must return itself (CR 603.3, 608.2d). Nothing is chosen (a single candidate asks no question),
# and the Garrison is back in hand. The control, a choice among two lands, is boros-garrison-enters-tapped-and-returns-a-land-to-hand.

[Bot1 Deck]
Boros Garrison
Plains x19

[Bot2 Deck]
Plains x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Boros Garrison.Play
! Bot1.Choose
[Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Count = 0
Bot1.Hand.Count = 7
Bot1.LandsPlayed = 1
